  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Similar problem to the one mentioned here https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/fix-the-internet-downloading-speed-in-taiwan-area\n\nBasically the download speed for anything vrchat related doesn't go above 30-35mbit. \n\nBefore the Index update came around it was saturating my 250mbit download speed just fine but since then it has been slowed down for whatever reason. I've tried everything and am 100% certain it's not my internet, I asked a few friends who also live in Germany and they're getting the same exact speed even though some have even faster internet than mine.\n\nWould like to know if this was done to save costs because that is a valid reason after all even if a bit annoying for those with faster internet and whether or not this could be fixed.",
